{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13532","headline":"忆舍弟 · 于逖","name":"忆舍弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衰门少兄弟，兄弟唯两人。\n饥寒各流浪，感念伤我神。\n夏期秋未来，安知无他因。\n不怨别天长，但愿见尔身。\n茫茫天地间，万类各有亲。\n安知汝与我，乖隔同胡秦。\n何时对形影，愤懑当共陈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于逖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13532.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13532","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}